1
00:00:00,405 --> 00:00:03,445
(Bernadette:)...and the last one there
has to do the measuring.

2
00:00:04,284 --> 00:00:07,034
(Amy:)Guess I should get going too.

3
00:00:07,913 --> 00:00:10,243
(Amy:)Good night, painting Penny.

4
00:00:10,957 --> 00:00:12,457
(Amy:)Good night, real Penny.

5
00:00:13,543 --> 00:00:14,793
(Penny:)Good night, real Amy.

6
00:00:16,087 --> 00:00:19,967
(Amy:)You don't have to say good night
to painting Amy, she's never leaving.

7
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:25,850
(Amy:)- Good night, real Penny.
- Bye.

8
00:00:26,056 --> 00:00:28,136
(Bernadette:)Good night, transvestite Penny.

9
00:00:32,103 --> 00:00:35,903
(Penny:)Okay, let us take you off the wall.

10
00:00:37,442 --> 00:00:40,782
(Penny:)Out of sight, out of mind.

11
00:00:40,987 --> 00:00:42,827
l wish.

12
00:00:45,575 --> 00:00:46,995
(Amy(entering):)Can I borrow that movie?

13
00:00:47,202 --> 00:00:49,912
(Amy(entering):)Those singing hooligans
really got my motor running.

14
00:00:50,747 --> 00:00:52,077
(Penny:)Sure, sure. Enjoy.

15
00:00:52,290 --> 00:00:54,710
You get it back to me
when you can or...

16
00:00:54,918 --> 00:00:57,128
(Penny:)You keep it.
It's just gonna be my gift to you.

